  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0028_629a628af729.png\" style=\"width:2.696in;height:1.5459in\" /><br />Let <math><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></math> be tower and objects are placed at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>B</mi></math>, then<br />The distance between the objects<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>45</mn><mi>o</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>45</mn><mi>o</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>{</mo><mi>from</mi><mo> </mo><mi>Δ</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Δ</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>}</mo></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow